Looking at this problem, I need to find the automorphism group of the Hirzebruch surface $\mathbf{F}_n = \mathbb{P}(\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{P}^1} \oplus \mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{P}^1}(n))$.

